# Modbus / RS485

- Master on RS485 (THVD1450 / level-safe). Honor DE·RE timing for the active board profile.
- DSE 73xx-class maps and GenComm pages: treat `doc/dse_register_map/` as source of truth.
- CRC fail ≠ successful poll. Do not advance “last good poll” on invalid frames.
- Lab profiles (Invendis, EN-Volt) stay explicit — do not merge into DSE map blindly.
- Captures/tools under `tools/` and `doc/captures/` for page dumps; keep reproducible.
- Fail closed on write/control paths: authenticate CLI/session before SCF / control writes.
